      "widgets_values": [
        "absurdres, masterpiece, score 7, score 8, Two anime-style schoolgirls recline amidst a dense bed of greenery and colorful wildflowers in this vibrant digital illustration. The girl on the left has brown hair tied into twin tails with teal ribbons and a yellow duck clip, featuring one bright yellow-green eye and one blue eye as she smiles softly with her hands clasped near her chest. Beside her, the second girl has long, loose brownish-grey hair and teal eyes, pointing upward with her right index finger while resting her left hand on her uniform collar; both wear matching sailor-style uniforms consisting of white tops with navy collars, light blue neckerchiefs tied in bows, and dark grey pleated skirts featuring a checkered pattern on the lower panels. They lie back in the grass surrounded by bluebells, daisies, and red blooms, bathed in warm sunlight that casts soft highlights on their hair while scattered prismatic lens flares create a dreamy summer atmosphere around them.",
